Depends on what you're worried about.  Magic resistance protects you
from wands of death, striking, and magic missile.  Reflection will
protect you (and your stuff) from wands of death, magic missile, sleep,
fire, cold, and lightning.  An elf will get sleep resistance
automatically, and fire and cold may be picked up; shock can take
longer to get.  (Reflection will also protect from disintegration
blasts, but you should live so long as to see a black dragon.)

